# The food chain a start of the generated map can staff. The castle's click places it at 15,5 (flag 16,6). The fisher's, butcher's, and baker's
# sites stand at 18,5, 18,9, and 20,12; one road leads from the castle's flag to the fisher's, one on to the butcher's, and one on to the
# baker's. The castle's 20 first settlers hold 5 jobless ones, and each road's carrier and each worker without a tool takes one: the
# butcher takes the knife from the stock and a jobless settler, the baker a jobless settler, and the fisher is among the 20.
# Run it on the game view with seed 4455544685788642 and size 1, under either graphics source:
#   sh tools/play-run.sh food-chain --game-view --seed 4455544685788642 --size 1 --fps 10
#   sh tools/play-run.sh food-chain --game-view --seed 4455544685788642 --size 1 --fps 10 --graphics open-settlers
expect seed = 4455544685788642
expect size = 1
wait 0.3
click-tile 15 5
wait 0.3
button Fisher
click-tile 18 5
button Fisher
wait 0.3
button Road
click-tile 16 6
click-tile 17 6
click-tile 18 6
click-tile 19 6
button Road
wait 0.3
fast-forward fisher state 0x20 max 60000
shot fisher 19 6 4 4
button Butcher
click-tile 18 9
button Butcher
wait 0.3
button Road
click-tile 19 6
click-tile 19 7
click-tile 19 8
click-tile 19 9
click-tile 19 10
button Road
wait 0.3
fast-forward until ticks >= 40000 max 60000
shot butcher 19 9 4 4
button Baker
click-tile 20 12
button Baker
wait 0.3
button Road
click-tile 19 10
click-tile 20 10
click-tile 21 11
click-tile 21 12
click-tile 21 13
button Road
wait 0.3
expect-count building = 4
fast-forward until bread >= 8 max 200000
shot drawn 19 9 5 5
wait 0.5
shot chain 19 9 5 5
expect fish >= 8
expect meat >= 6
expect bread >= 8
list chain
dump chain
